    {
      "severity": "major",
      "title": "Feedback FB-002 (behaviour): Refuse IPv6 forms that carry an IPv4 address",
      "detail": "These IPv6 forms embed an IPv4 address, and the guard classifies them by their IPv6 prefix only, so an embedded private IPv4 address is not refused; the current list does not include them. Add the three ranges to nonPublicRanges in apps/proxy-plugin/internal/egress/public.go; every other address keeps its classification.",
      "source": "feedback",
